{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Fast TTK 3v3 FPS from Epic Games vets. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in the distant future of 1999, the Waifu Tactical Force is an elite PMC tasked with deterring a political conspiracy aiming to enact a global technology meltdown through the Y2K glitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">No sweats, just ~vibes~</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PVP Movement shooter: Run, dash, slide, double jump and use mobility items to get the drop on other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two game modes: Gunfight and Kill Confirmed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dating Sim / Visual Novel with separate progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your base and army of kawaii killers to unlock in-game benefits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and Collect NPC waifus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Squad system, alternate loadout sets between matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable loadouts, with a wide variety of weapon and ability combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alt Y2K narrative and aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new abilities, weapons, skins, stickers/medals/emblems, soldier waifus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local dedicated servers</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sign up at the website or Discord for early playtests!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2353050?t=1743455582","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/334f0fb6b9626886d6bf65797e384bfd6b1f5872/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743455582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/14070d574be0b5bc86f74550e064d83f960b82bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743455582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akama